    "body": "Unless something has changed since I wrote this Starship itself is very limited in this regard.\r\n\r\nIt will not detect files in sub-directories such as `.mise/config.toml`.\r\nAnd you cannot supply a wildcard pattern like `.mise.*.toml` or `**/.mise.toml`.\r\n\r\nSo the only thing I could do is guess common environment names like `.mise.prod.toml`, but `detect_files` is user configurable so I'd rather leave that for users to decide.",
    "created_at": "2024-10-09T13:01:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-09T13:01:19Z",
